  "details": "I think the avatars with spawn in music has gotten out of control. It’s very intrusive for a social game, sometimes offensive. I know we can block all music on avatars or turn avatar sounds off (although people have found a way of bypassing this). \nI believe a new rule should be created about doing intrusive sounds on avatars. Obviously not disabling avatar sounds as that would limit creativity. \nMaybe force a limit to how far sounds can travel etc.. \nSomething should be done about it.",
